completions_5:
Josie's farm produces 5 tons of grapes per acre per year. Since she has 10 acres, the total production is 5 tons/acre * 10 acres = 50 tons of grapes per year.
Each ton of grapes makes 2 barrels of wine. Thus, 50 tons of grapes make 50 tons * 2 barrels/ton = 100 barrels of wine per year.

\boxed{100}

